WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:05.960
You know, they say the best things in life
are free, like headshots!

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:11.070
I’m Colin for theScore esports and this
week on Best of, we’re pinching our pennies

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.610
and taking a look at the best eco rounds and force buys in CS:GO.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.760
I mean, you know how it is.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:24.880
You spent all that cash on AWP no armour get your sh-t wrecked, and now your team’s dirt poor.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.420
But have no fear, because even on default
pistols, magic can happen.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.090
Just ask the players in our first section.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.979
I’m all out of money!

00:00:35.979 --> 00:00:41.199
And just to be clear here guys, when we say default pistols, I’m talking about rounds where

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.020
the majority of team is USPs or Glocks.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:49.140
P250, CZ here and there, meh it doesn’t
bother me.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:02:04.500
(casting)

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:10.040
I declare bankruptcy!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:05:50.000
(casting)

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:54.960
So not all eco rounds are a complete wash.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:59.200
Sometimes you got a 
little bit of cash and it’s burning a hole in your pocket.

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:05.200
And before you teammates and type “save”, you’ve blown your wad on that sweet sweet Scout.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:07.360
Don’t tell me how to spend my money.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:10.160
I mean, you gotta spend money to make money right?

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:31.300
(casting)

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.560
Oh, great Odin’s raven.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:07:52.480
(casting)

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:58.080
Not like this, not like this.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:10:02.480
(casting)

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:04.080
It's free real estate.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:17:09.040
(casting)

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.440
Ever find 20 bucks in 
your coat pocket?

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:15.040
I’m talkin bout this.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.160
Feels good, right?

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:21.700
Well, not as good as finding an AK-47 on the ground when you’ve invested little or
nothing in the round.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:21:25.700
(casting)

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:30.720
Well guys, that’s all we’ve got 
for you on Best of this week.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:39.840
Now, I’m not gonna lie to you, my whole
life is like an eco round... maybe a force buy at best.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.200
So go ahead, hit that like button, and sub to the channel, and put your boi Colin on that full buy.

